 972		expanded local spaces, as explained in
 973		\cite{gap:qpbt_linearity-theorem-quotation}.
 974		Form $R^{x,z}_{a,b}=Z_bX_aZ_b$ as in
 975		Definition~\ref{def:field-point-sandwich}. Its mean consistency defect
 976		between opposite placements is at most $C_0(\eps+\sqrt{\eps})$ by
